  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">NRGI Developing capacity on extractive sector DRM amid the energy transition - Ghana</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project aims at  efficiently and equitably manage the risks and opportunities of the global energy transition for domestic resource mobilisation (DRM)  from the extractive sector,

The overall project&#x2019;s expected effect(s) on society is/are (Impact): 
Developing countries have improved financing for national development priorities and the SDGs through increased tax renevue and strengthened social contract. 
The expected effect for the target group of the project are (Outcome): 
Outcome 1: Ghana and Uganda efficiently and equitably manage the risks and opportunities of the global energy transition for domestic resource mobilisation from the extractive sector. 
Outcome 2: Improved international cooperation and south-south collaboration between civil society and media actors on the impacts of energy transition for the extractive sector and domestic resource mobilisation.</narrative>
  </description>
